  * Lotus input method: its APT source asks for amd64 only, so apt update
    no longer prints the i386 notice (migration 20261117100000).
  * ISO: the UEFI boot menu of the live USB counts down 10 s and uses a
    larger font with Vietnamese help text (machines with Secure Boot keep
    GRUB's built-in font).

